# Missions: a race step lost. Standing at the top of the crooked block arms the race (within 15 m);
# Brayden rides the eight hairpins without you (easing up to 3.6 m/s, about 55 s), reaches the foot first, and the
# mission fails (lost; the client says his line); his actor goes with the mission.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 mission start lombard 1
cmd 0 teleport -300 697 28.2 90
run 7000
expect event missionStep{mission=lombard,step=1,kind=race} within 1..1
expect event missionFailed{mission=lombard,step=1,reason=lost} within 6590..6640
expect no event missionStep{mission=lombard,step=2}
